        "description": "Identification of pathogenic mutations in the HAL gene",
        "category": "major",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      },
      {
        "id": "clinical-assessment",
        "description": "Absence of significant clinical symptoms or neurological impairment",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of elevated histidine levels and histidase enzyme deficiency",
    "notes": "Genetic testing supports diagnosis but is not mandatory; clinical symptoms are often absent."
